	 Requirement: 21+ (Valid photo ID required)\nMinimum Purchase: Two-item mi
	nimum per person in showroom \nAbout Desi Banks\nDesi Banks is a comedian\
	, actor\, and social media personality who has amassed millions of followe
	rs with his hilarious character-driven videos and relatable everyday humor
	. He has toured extensively across the country\, bringing his unique comed
	ic voice to sold-out venues. His stand-up blends storytelling\, impression
	s\, and sharp observational comedy. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-
	up comedy performance\nHilarious character impressions and storytelling\nR
	elatable humor about everyday life\nIntimate club atmosphere at San Jose I
	mprov\nFull bar and food service available\nAn unforgettable night of laug
	hs\n\nVenue Information\nSan Jose Improv is located in the heart of downto
	wn San Jose at 62 S Second St. This premier comedy club offers an intimate
	 setting with excellent sightlines and full bar and dining service. The ve
	nue is 21+ for this event. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $37. Thi
	s is a 21+ event — valid photo ID required. All sales are final. Ticket re
	sale is strictly prohibited by the venue. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tic
