DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nFunny Marco LIVE at The Block at Harrah’s Philadel
	phia\nGet ready for a night of nonstop laughs as internet sensation and co
	median Funny Marco takes the stage at The Block at Harrah’s Philadelphia i
	n Chester\, PA on August 22\, 2026. Known for his wild street interviews\,
	 unpredictable humor\, and explosive energy\, Funny Marco delivers a live 
	comedy experience you won’t forget. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, Augu
	st 22\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM (Doors open 60 minutes prior)\nVenue: The Bloc
	k at Harrah’s Philadelphia\nAddress: 777 Harrah’s Blvd\, Chester\, PA 1901
	3\nAge Requirement: Age restrictions may vary — see event page for details
	\nParking: Free parking available 24/7 at Harrah’s Philadelphia \nAbout Fu
	nny Marco\nFunny Marco is a viral comedian and content creator who rose to
	 fame through his hilarious man-on-the-street interview videos. His unique
	 ability to find comedy in everyday situations has earned him millions of 
	followers and a devoted fanbase. Now he’s bringing his unfiltered\, high-e
	nergy style to the live stage for an unforgettable night of laughs. \nWhat
	 to Expect\n\nWild\, unpredictable stand-up comedy from a viral internet s
	ensation\nHigh-energy performance with crowd interaction\nA unique blend o
	f street humor and storytelling\nCasino venue with full amenities and free
	 parking\nAn unforgettable night of laughs near Philadelphia\nLimited tick
	ets available — secure your seats early\n\nVenue Information\nThe Block at
	 Harrah’s Philadelphia is an entertainment venue located at Harrah’s Phila
	delphia Casino & Racetrack in Chester\, PA\, just minutes from downtown Ph
	iladelphia. The venue offers free parking\, full casino amenities\, and an
	 exciting atmosphere for live entertainment. \nTicket Information\nTickets
	 are available now through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale 
	marketplace). Average ticket price is approximately $59. There is an 8-tic
	ket limit per person. Early arrival is advised. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale
	 Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales a
	re final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for
	 entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/funny-marco-live-at-the-block-
	at-harrahs-philadelphia/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
