	need a valid photo ID and the credit card used for purchase. Accessible ti
	ckets can be purchased online - you do not need to call the box office to 
	place an order. Look for the logo on the Find Tickets page to view all ava
	ilable accessible seats. We do have accessible seating in every price rang
	e but be advised it may sell out. We have very limited seating available f
	or guests on the day of the event so please make sure you purchase accessi
	ble seating when you order tickets. Bags up to 12" x 6" x 12" are allowed 
